            'about_h3' => 'Hi, I\'m Matheus.', 'about_p1' => 'I\'m a senior software developer based in São Paulo, Brazil. I built a healthcare company\'s entire management system on my own, led digital projects for large pharmaceutical companies and spent over two years on a remote tech team in Germany.', 'about_p2' => 'Now I use that experience, plus the best AI tools, to give small businesses the same technology big companies have, without agency prices or red tape.', 'about_link' => 'Read my story →',
