        'builds' => [['Digital loyalty cards', 'Stamps on the phone, automatic rewards'], ['Instant online quotes', 'Customers see the price and book on their own'], ['Smart waitlists', 'A slot opens, the next person is notified'], ['Websites for cafés, restaurants and shops', 'With menus, catalogs and online ordering'], ['Digital menus and catalogs', 'QR code on the table, orders on WhatsApp'], ['Digital and NFC business cards', 'Tap the phone, contact saved'], ['AI chatbots and assistants', 'On WhatsApp, your website and Instagram'], ['AI-powered tools', 'Read documents, write proposals, summarize'], ['Inventory and sales dashboards', 'Everything that matters on one screen'], ['Online booking', 'With automatic reminders and deposits'], ['Online stores', 'Cards, wallets, shipping and order alerts'], ['Website security checks', 'Find the gaps before someone else does'], ['Automations and integrations', 'Spreadsheets, CRM, email and WhatsApp talking'], ['Custom software', 'Customers, scheduling, finance, client portal'], ['Website redesigns', 'Faster, better-looking and easier to find']],
        'faq' => [
            ['Do I need to know anything about tech?', 'No. You tell me how your business works and I handle the rest. I\'ll only show you what you\'ll use, in plain language.'],
            ['How long does it take?', 'A digital card takes 2 days, a digital menu 3, a landing page 5 and a website 7 to 10 days. Bigger projects are delivered in weekly milestones.'],
            ['How does payment work?', 'You get a fixed price before we start. Usually half upfront and half on delivery, or by milestone for larger projects. Payment by card, PayPal, Wise or bank transfer.'],
            ['Will I own the website and domain?', 'Yes. Everything I build is yours: domain, content and access.'],
            ['You\'re in Brazil. Does that work for me?', 'Yes. I worked for over two years with a team in Germany. We talk by WhatsApp, email or video call, in English, and I overlap with US and European business hours.'],
            ['What if I need help later?', 'Every project includes 30 days of free tweaks. After that, you can stay on a care plan or just reach out when you need something.'],
        ],
