            'challenges' => [['Being a company\'s entire IT team', 'At C3 I was the only developer. From the database to the server, from support to new features, everything went through me. I learned to prioritize what matters most to the business.'], ['Working with a European team', 'At Picalike every decision was discussed in writing, with code reviews and clear deadlines across time zones. That\'s still how I work with clients.'], ['Delivering for demanding brands', 'At Madurado, campaigns for big pharmaceutical companies had fixed event dates. "A little late" didn\'t exist.']],
